  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Magistrates&apos; Courts, Serb</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Magistrates&apos; Courts, Serb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projekt avser allokering av medel f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka s.k. Magistrates&apos; Courts i Serbien dels genom utbildningsinsatser, dels genom  reformst&#xf6;d. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs av UNDP med Justitieministeriet som fr&#xe4;msta motpart.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has received a project proposal from UNDP with the objective to reform the magistrate system in Serbia towards independence and impartiality. The project aims at strengthening the system of Misdemeanours and Magistrates&apos; Courts by providing training and developing a reform strategy. The main counterpart will be the Serbian Ministry of Justice.</narrative>
  </description>
